 1** orders 1.0 times the forecast for both products, so it runs short of the expensive product 0.\n- **Candidate 4** orders about 1.25 times for both. That is too much, especially for product 1, so it wastes the most.\n- **Candidate 3** orders about 1.1 times for both, which is reasonable.\n- **Candidate 7** orders about 1.15 times but cuts the last orders. Stock left at the end is worth nothing, so cutting them saves roughly 440.\n- **Candidate 5** orders 1.2 times for product 0 and 0.95 times for product 1, which fits the costs well. It does not cut the last orders, though.\n\nI rank candidate 7 first, then 5 and 3. Candidates 4 and 1 come next, and the plans that order daily or less often than every two days come last."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4377, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4377}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:38:43.339Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVMfv1j9HcGiAad9Peiz"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01X9euRD4KwscZTVGKBBRJMz", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVMfvGbvZm3429F5aNpk", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01X9euRD4KwscZTVGKBBRJMz", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.03, 0.07, 0.03, 0.2, 0.08, 0.25, 0.04, 0.3]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}]